/* §5 background-pattern consumption-side verification (#777 I-E): a background
 * whose ONLY sprite paint is a tiled pattern (pattern: pat), drawn by the
 * background pass's FIRST DRAW — a fullscreen quad (fs_pattern) that wraps each
 * screen pixel into the sprite's atlas sub-rect (analytic tiling). The clear
 * paints the fill first; the pattern tiles on top across the whole viewport.
 *
 * A background-pattern-only style (no labels / icons / fill-patterns) still
 * loads its sprite atlas: the IconStage sprite-atlas gate (label-pass.ts) fires
 * on `_backgroundPattern`, so no helper icon / fill-pattern layer is needed.
 *
 * Load with: /demo.html?id=fixture_bg_pattern&e2e=1&sprite=/fixture-sprite
 * §5 probe (orchestrator-run): DC>0 across the full viewport + MapLibre A/B on
 * the same style; re-run on backend=webgl2 once #1046 F4 flips the pass.
 */
background { fill: #1a1a2e pattern: pat }
